# Pinned external ROS sources for the Unitree hg real-hardware bringup
# (`launch/real_bringup.launch.py`). Sim needs none of this — the G1 MuJoCo twin
# (`openral_hal.g1.G1MujocoHAL`) is pure Python.
#
# Target: ROS 2 Jazzy (issue #565). isaac_ros_robots pinned 2026-11-07 at its HEAD;
# isaac_ros_deploy re-pinned 2026-11-12 to tag v4.6-0 (3e84f85a, the source of the Isaac ROS
# apt release-4 `ros-jazzy-isaac-ros-deploy-*` 4.6.0): its HEAD / v5.0-0 (f3aa6b89) needs
# ROS 2 Lyrical (`cuda_buffer`, `urdf/model.hpp`). v4.6 has no stale-input watchdog and
# re-reads the measured pose on a NaN reference; openral_hal_unitree's
# GuardedInferenceController / GuardedSafetyController restore v5.0's behaviour on top of it.
# isaac_ros_robots stays at 520aa94f (release-4 has no unitree_hg_ros2_control). Built and
# gtested together on Jazzy (q5090, x86_64); NOT yet validated on a real G1 — the first
# hardware bring-up re-validates (and, if needed, re-pins) them.
#
#   isaac_ros_robots  (Apache-2.0)  unitree_hg/unitree_hg_ros2_control (UnitreeHgSystemInterface,
#                                   G1 + H2), unitree_g1/unitree_g1_description (real xacro)
#   isaac_ros_deploy  (Apache-2.0)  isaac_ros_deploy_ros2_control (SafetyController,
#                                   InferenceController, ForwardJointCommandController,
#                                   FreezeController), isaac_ros_deploy_interfaces, isaac_deploy_core
#
# Not listed, deliberately:
#   * unitree_sdk2 — unitree_hg_ros2_control's CMake FetchContent pins its own revision
#     (21d0a3b2c46ee48c8fdf2783becb6be3beb0a59b) plus Cyclone DDS 0.10.2
#     (9995905bce6c4cf9f740d6438bbf7fcfd1c83dfd, patched), at build time.
#   * unitreerobotics/unitree_ros2 (BSD-3, HEAD 668d1ec5a05d1c38d3306bdca7d59f2ba3581a88) —
#     none of the packages above depends on its unitree_hg / unitree_go message packages;
#     the hardware interface speaks the SDK's own DDS types.
#   * isaac_ros_tensor_list_interfaces / triton-server / python3-torch-pip-shim /
#     python3-onnx-pip-shim — Isaac ROS apt packages and rosdep keys pulled in by
#     isaac_ros_deploy; install them from the Isaac ROS apt repository, release 4 (README).
#   * isaac_ros_agile_unitree_g1 — the AGILE policy's LEAPP export (data package), not
#     shipped in either repo; see README "S0 policy".
#
# Import into a colcon workspace's `src/` with:
#   vcs import src < packages/openral_hal_unitree/deps.repos
#   rosdep install --from-paths src --ignore-src -y
#   colcon build --packages-up-to unitree_hg_ros2_control unitree_g1_description \
#       isaac_ros_deploy_ros2_control
repositories:
  isaac_ros_robots:
    type: git
    url: https://github.com/NVIDIA-ISAAC-ROS/isaac_ros_robots.git
    version: 520aa94ffb7732467870a87dcb66a8bfd33cbe60
  isaac_ros_deploy:
    type: git
    url: https://github.com/NVIDIA-ISAAC-ROS/isaac_ros_deploy.git
    version: 3e84f85aff8ce157d376b16b6fab07bf877b3abd
